%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial", "fontSize": "15px", "primaryColor": "#EEF2FF", "primaryBorderColor": "#5B5FC7", "primaryTextColor": "#1F2937", "actorBkg": "#EEF2FF", "actorBorder": "#5B5FC7", "actorTextColor": "#1F2937", "signalColor": "#374151", "signalTextColor": "#111827", "noteBkgColor": "#FFF7E6", "noteBorderColor": "#F0B44C", "activationBkgColor": "#E0E7FF", "sequenceNumberColor": "#FFFFFF"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Case IQ - from officer upload to answer in Teams (Officer A)

    actor Officer as Officer A (Aadi)
    actor Approver as Approver (admin)
    participant Blob as Case Blob<br/>officer-a-pending
    participant Logic as Logic App<br/>every 5 min
    participant Job as Private ingestion job
    participant CU as Content Understanding<br/>custom analyzer
    participant Evidence as Officer A<br/>evidence storage
    participant Search as Foundry IQ<br/>Officer A index + KB
    participant Teams as Microsoft Teams
    participant Agent as Foundry agent<br/>Case IQ - Officer A

    rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
    Note over Officer,Evidence: Upload and analysis
    Officer->>Blob: Upload case-a-receipt.pdf (Azure Portal)
    Logic->>Job: Start reconcile (job idle)
    Job->>Blob: Read new PDF version
    Job->>CU: Analyze exact version (in geography)
    CU-->>Job: Page text + fields (receipt no., amounts, dates)
    Job->>Evidence: Save analysis - awaiting approval
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 235)
    Note over Approver,Blob: Independent approval
    Approver->>Blob: Set tag approval = approved
    end

    rect rgb(238, 250, 242)
    Note over Logic,Search: Publish and private indexing
    Logic->>Job: Start reconcile
    Job->>Blob: Read approval tag
    Job->>Job: Confirm approved version = analyzed version
    Job->>Evidence: Record approval in ledger
    Job->>Evidence: Write page + field records (approved, officer, page)
    Job->>Search: Run private indexer
    Search-->>Job: Indexed, 0 failures
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
    Note over Officer,Agent: Chat in Teams
    Officer->>Teams: "How much was paid on receipt RCPT-A-9120?"
    Teams->>Agent: Message (Officer A access verified)
    Agent->>Search: knowledge_base_retrieve
    Search-->>Agent: Approved Officer A evidence only
    Agent-->>Teams: "CAD 4,000.00 - case-a-receipt.pdf, page 1"
    Teams-->>Officer: Answer with source
    end
